## How to use this template

1. Save as `CLAUDE.md` at your project root.
2. Fill in PRODUCT MAP, KEY DATES, KEY LINKS first — these unlock the rest.
3. Trim sections you don't use yet. Add them back when you actually need them.
4. Re-read it quarterly. Anything stale or never-referenced — cut.
5. The harness is a living document. Edit it whenever a session reveals a missing rule.
